AUDIO: 'I\'ve been on the hunt to find an affordable webcam that can compete with my regular $5,000 video call setup, but one that\'s more portable and easy to use when I\'m on the go. I need this webcam to really do three things. First, it needs to have really good image quality.'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'It doesn\'t have to be best of the best, but very good. Second would be some customizable settings so I can dial in my creative look, but not be overly complex. And third would be a quality audio setup so I don\'t have to lug'

