VISUAL: A person holds the compact, black Hollyland Lyra webcam.
AUDIO: 'around a massive kit for my video calls. And would you look at what just slid across my desk this morning from Hollland. This is their Holland Lyra. And this is their most affordable webcam at only $149. When you first open up the box, you\'ll see that Holland Lyra webcam'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
