AUDIO: 'the frame, it\'ll track me. Move over here, it\'ll track me. If I kind of zoom back, it\'ll try to like recompose the shot to keep the same frame, which is super interesting. If I kind of come back a little bit closer, it\'ll rewind'

[06:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'out the shot. So, kind of cool. You have a little built-in camera operator if you\'re somebody who needs to move around a little bit more in your live streams or video calls. [music] And then beyond that, you can actually add some preset scene sizes, which are pretty cool. So,'

