[08:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'now to record this video. This is great for video creators and online coaches who want to increase their audio quality, but still be a little bit mobile and free and not like tied down right to a podcast microphone that\'s like right in front of their face. This'

