AUDIO: 'you just clip right onto your shirt. It\'s so lightweight, you won\'t even really notice it\'s there, and it\'s going to improve your overall sound. There is also noise cancellation that you can leverage with this system. Even the Lark A1 has noise cancellation directly. So,'

